    "summary_one_sentence": "Hoping to escape their failing marriage and claim life insurance payouts, a resentful couple retreats to a remote cabin to secretly murder each other, only to be forced into an unexpected alliance when dangerous escaped convicts crash their deadly retreat.",
    "summary_short": "Dan and Lisa are a deeply unhappy married couple who head to an isolated lakeside cabin under the pretense of saving their struggling marriage. Unbeknownst to each other, both have devised meticulous plans to murder their spouse and claim a lucrative insurance payout. However, their deadly confrontation is abruptly interrupted when they discover three dangerous escaped convicts hiding in the cabin's attic. Forced to set aside their spousal rivalry, the couple must work together in a bloody fight for survival against a far greater threat.",
    "summary_long": "Married couple Dan and Lisa have reached a breaking point in their toxic relationship, burdened by debt, resentment, and career failures. Seeking an escape, they head to Dan's family's remote lakeside cabin, claiming to use the weekend trip to reconnect and repair their marriage. In reality, both spouses have independently plotted to murder each other during the retreat to collect a substantial life insurance payout. Shortly after arriving, tensions boil over, and their secret schemes implode into an all-out physical brawl filled with improvised weapons and bloody chaos. Just as Dan gains the upper hand, the couple's violent showdown is unexpectedly halted when they uncover three armed escaped convicts hiding in the attic. Taken hostage by the ruthless criminals, the pair is forced to endure brutal psychological and physical torment inside the secluded home. Realizing that neither will survive alone, Dan and Lisa grudgingly form a bloody alliance to outsmart and overpower their captors. Utilizing brutal improvised traps and sheer desperation, the husband and wife reignite their forgotten spark through explosive, coordinated violence. Ultimately, their shared struggle to defeat the invaders repairs their broken bond, turning a murderous getaway into an absurdly violent marital triumph.",
    "synopsis": "Over Your Dead Body is a high-octane dark comedy thriller starring Jason Segel and Samara Weaving as Dan and Lisa, a bitterly alienated married couple drowning in resentment and financial distress. Desperate for a fresh start, both sign up for a weekend getaway at a secluded mountain cabin under the guise of working on their relationship. Behind closed doors, however, each spouse has secretly devised a lethal plan to murder the other and claim the insurance money. When their hidden motives surface, the romantic retreat instantly devolves into a vicious, free-for-all brawl. However, the chaos escalates even further when they cross paths with a gang of ruthless escaped convicts taking refuge in the same cabin. Trapped together in a remote wilderness with violent criminals, Dan and Lisa must set aside their murderous grudges and pool their destructive talents to survive the night.",
